        "structural_description": "Reduces the Energy cost of your Formations and increases their effectiveness by 25%."
      },
      {
        "name": "Paragon",
        "claim_ids": [
          "talent:guardian/vanguard:18-7-2-9"
        ],
        "structural_description": "Blocking an attack grants you a stack of Paragon for 10 seconds. Can only occur once every 0.5 sec.At 10 stacks, your Heavy Blow transforms into Paragon Smash for 10 seconds.Paragon Smash (Damage)Deals 144 + 37% AP Physical damage to all nearby enemies.Increases your chance to block by 10% and each block reduces the cooldown of Brace by -2 sec. Lasts for 5 blocks or 10 seconds.Scales with modifiers to Heavy Blow.Casting Heavy Blow instantly grants 3 stacks of this effect."
      }
